    "firstrun.ledger.themes" : {
      "comment" : "One line of the welcome card's list. %1$lld is how many colour themes ship, %2$lld how many accent colours — both counted from the code, so the sentence cannot go stale. \"Yours\" means unlocked, with nothing to buy.",
